      "title": "Tailscale didn't stop the Hugging Face intrusion",
      "url": "https://tailscale.com/blog/hugging-face-intrusion",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49127306",
      "score": 610,
      "comments": 213,
      "author": "bluehatbrit",
      "published": "2026-07-31T19:03:45Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Overlay networks like Tailscale cannot block unauthorized access if attackers obtain compromised Hugging Face API tokens or application secrets.",
        "AI infrastructure security requires application-layer zero-trust controls, fine-grained token permissions, and aggressive secret scanning rather than perimeter defense.",
        "Machine learning platforms hosting sensitive models and datasets remain vulnerable to credential theft regardless of underlying VPN or mesh networking."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "rss",
