      "score": null,
      "comments": null,
      "author": "Alexander Neubeck",
      "published": "2026-07-31T16:00:00Z",
      "bullets": [
        "GitHub achieved case-folding throughput exceeding 45 GiB/s on a single CPU core for its code search engine.",
        "Branch-free loops eliminate CPU branch misprediction penalties during high-volume text and string normalization tasks.",
        "Byte-space arithmetic processes raw character streams directly at memory bandwidth limits without control-flow overhead."
      ]
